flowchart TD
    Call["calls<br/>trace_sched_switch(<br/>preempt, prev, next)<br/>does: reach<br/>TRACE_EVENT site<br/>state: typed<br/>args available"]
    Gate["tracepoint<br/>dispatch<br/>does: check<br/>attached listener<br/>families<br/>why next: skip<br/>unused interfaces<br/>state: static<br/>keys select path"]
    Copy["regular<br/>tracepoint<br/>path<br/>does: copy<br/>fields into<br/>trace_event_<br/>raw_sched_<br/>switch<br/>why next:<br/>stable struct<br/>state: ctx =<br/>copied bytes"]
    Raw["raw_<br/>tracepoint<br/>path<br/>does: args<br/>in raw<br/>u64 slots<br/>why next:<br/>unpack by<br/>index<br/>state:<br/>ctx->args[N]"]
    BTF["tp_btf<br/>path<br/>does: BTF<br/>args to<br/>trampoline<br/>wrapper<br/>why next:<br/>BPF_PROG<br/>typed params<br/>state:<br/>typed in<br/>callback"]
    Return["return to<br/>scheduler<br/>does: resume<br/>after programs<br/>state: side<br/>effects done"]

    Call --> Gate
    Gate -->|tracepoint listener| Copy --> Return
    Gate -->|raw_tracepoint listener| Raw --> Return
    Gate -->|tp_btf listener| BTF --> Return

